  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development Existing: Use of outbuilding as self contained flat (1 x 1bed)\r\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The Local Planning Authority is not satisfied that\r\nconsistent evidence has been provided to demonstrate that, on the balance of\r\nprobabilities, the outbuilding to the rear of 147 Malvern Gardens HA3 9PQ, has\r\nbeen in use as a self-contained dwelling for a continuous period of at least\r\n4&amp;nbsp;years prior to the date of this application. The existing development is\r\ntherefore considered to be unlawful and as such the Local Planning Authority\r\nrefuse to issue a Certificate of Lawful Existing Development.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
